---
import PageFrame from "../components/PageFrame.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Logos AI"
  description="Study the Bible with AI online or offline, start free, bring your own key when you want control, or upgrade into a managed experience."
>
  <PageFrame current="home">
    <main>
      <section class="shell grid gap-10 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.9fr] lg:items-center">
        <div class="animate-rise">
          <p class="eyebrow">Study the Bible with AI - online or offline.</p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl font-display text-6xl leading-tight text-text md:text-7xl">
            A free Bible study desk that starts in the browser and gets richer when you install the app.
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-6 section-copy">
            Use Logos AI in your browser for a guided reading experience, then move into the desktop app for offline
            study, read-aloud, AI commentary, and deeper workflows. Keep the free core meaningful. Charge for
            convenience, setup removal, and richer output.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a href="/try" class="cta-primary">Try web version</a>
            <a href="/download" class="cta-secondary">Download app</a>
            <a href="/pricing" class="cta-secondary">View pricing</a>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
            <span class="rounded-full border border-gold/30 bg-gold/10 px-4 py-2 text-gold">Free core</span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-4 py-2 text-accent">BYOK ready</span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-border bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 text-muted">Managed upgrade path</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="animate-float">
          <div class="surface-card overflow-hidden p-4">
            <div class="rounded-[1.7rem] border border-border/80 bg-bg/60 p-4">
              <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted">Try It Now</div>
                  <div class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl text-text">Web Reader</div>
                </div>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-gold/35 bg-gold/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">
                  Demo
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[220px_1fr]">
                <div class="rounded-[1.4rem] border border-border bg-surface/70 p-4">
                  <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted">Library</div>
                  <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gold/45 bg-highlight/70 px-4 py-3">
                      <div class="font-display text-lg text-text">DEMO</div>
                      <div class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Guided Web Demo</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg/45 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-text">Genesis</div>
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg/45 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-text">Psalms</div>
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg/45 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-text">John</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="rounded-[1.4rem] border border-border bg-surface/70 p-5">
                  <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted">Reader</div>
                      <div class="mt-1 font-display text-2xl text-text">Psalm 23</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">
                      Search
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-text">
                    <span class="mr-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">1</span>
                    The Lord is my shepherd; I shall not want. <span class="ml-2 mr-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">2</span>
                    He makes me lie down in green pastures.
                  </p>
                  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3">
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg/45 px-4 py-3">
                      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">No AI</div>
                      <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-text">Just reading and search in the browser.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg/45 px-4 py-3">
                      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Desktop depth</div>
                      <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-text">Voices, AI commentary, offline, and exports in the app.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-bg/45 px-4 py-3">
                      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Upgrade path</div>
                      <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-text">Managed AI later when convenience becomes worth paying for.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="shell py-14">
        <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
          <article class="surface-card p-6">
            <p class="eyebrow">Bible reading</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl text-text">Immediate value</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">
              The free tier is still good enough to recommend. Reading, passage search, and lightweight discovery happen
              before money enters the conversation.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="surface-card p-6">
            <p class="eyebrow">Optional AI</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl text-text">Convenience pays</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">
              BYOK covers power users. Managed AI removes setup friction. Packs and subscriptions accelerate work
              without holding the core experience hostage.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="surface-card p-6">
            <p class="eyebrow">Desktop app</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl text-text">Richer tooling</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">
              The downloadable app stays the primary product for offline study, voices, AI commentary, and future
              sermon-prep or church workflows.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="surface-card p-6">
            <p class="eyebrow">Trust</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl text-text">Privacy matters</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">
              Lead with usefulness, offline capability, and user control. Let pricing read as a convenience upgrade,
              not a plea about infrastructure cost.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="shell py-14">
        <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]">
          <div class="surface-card p-8">
            <p class="eyebrow">Website Funnel</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 section-title">The browser is the on-ramp, not the whole product.</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 section-copy">
              Let visitors feel value quickly in the web demo, then route them toward the richer desktop app and the
              later managed plans. The site should act as explanation layer, proof layer, download funnel, and upgrade
              funnel all at once.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
              <div class="rounded-[1.6rem] border border-border bg-bg/45 p-5">
                <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Top</div>
                <div class="mt-3 text-2xl font-display text-text">Discover</div>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Landing page, blog posts, clips, and community shares.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-[1.6rem] border border-border bg-bg/45 p-5">
                <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Middle</div>
                <div class="mt-3 text-2xl font-display text-text">Try</div>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Interactive reader, screenshots, and clear free versus paid positioning.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-[1.6rem] border border-border bg-bg/45 p-5">
                <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">Bottom</div>
                <div class="mt-3 text-2xl font-display text-text">Upgrade</div>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Managed access, premium voices, sermon tools, and cloud conveniences.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="surface-card p-8">
            <p class="eyebrow">Audience Segments</p>
            <div class="mt-5 space-y-4">
              <div class="rounded-[1.6rem] border border-border bg-bg/45 p-5">
                <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">Everyday Bible users</div>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Read, listen, and explore Scripture with AI help.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-[1.6rem] border border-border bg-bg/45 p-5">
                <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">Pastors and church leaders</div>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Go from passage to study outline faster.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-[1.6rem] border border-border bg-bg/45 p-5">
                <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">Christian tech and power users</div>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">A flexible Bible AI app for technical users who want control.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="shell py-14">
        <div class="surface-card p-8">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Pricing Paths</p>
              <h2 class="mt-3 section-title">Keep it simple early.</h2>
              <p class="mt-5 section-copy">
                Free gets adoption. BYOK handles zero-cost power users. Managed access becomes the main monetization
                lane once setup removal and reliability are worth paying for.
              </p>
            </div>

            <a href="/pricing" class="cta-secondary">Full pricing page</a>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="rounded-[1.8rem] border border-border bg-bg/45 p-6">
              <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted">Free</div>
              <div class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl text-text">$0</div>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Browser demo, app download, basic study, and enough value to build trust.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[1.8rem] border border-accent/40 bg-accent/5 p-6">
              <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-accent">Bring your own key</div>
              <div class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl text-text">Flexible</div>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Technical users keep full control without needing Logos AI to absorb every token cost.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[1.8rem] border border-gold/40 bg-gold/5 p-6">
              <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold">Managed</div>
              <div class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl text-text">$5-$15</div>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">No setup, hosted AI, premium voices, saved history, and priority usage.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="shell py-14">
        <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="surface-card p-8">
            <p class="eyebrow">Download</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 section-title">The full app is where the richer workflows live.</h2>
            <p class="mt-5 section-copy">
              Download the desktop app for read-aloud, offline-friendly study, AI commentary, and more advanced study
              flows than the browser should try to carry.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
              <a href="/download" class="cta-primary">Open downloads</a>
              <a href="https://docs.logos-ai.online" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="cta-secondary">Read setup docs</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="surface-card p-8">
            <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
            <div class="mt-5 space-y-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">Why is some AI paid?</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">The free core stays useful, while managed AI removes setup and bundles convenience.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">Can I use my own API key?</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Yes. BYOK is the control-first option for technical users and the zero-cost power-user path.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">Does it work offline?</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">The desktop app is the main offline-friendly experience. The browser is optimized for discovery and lighter use.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </PageFrame>
</SiteLayout>
